1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reba was first in line to succeed his father as balabat.  One day, he arrived late for g'b'r at Ras Gobena's hall after an equestrian exercise, and when the ilfign askelkay tried to block his entry, Reba pushed him
2 CONC  aside a bit too forcefully and the officer fell and died. After this incident, Reba was banned from the court and upon returning home disqualified from balabatship. His brother Wami became balabat instead.
