1 NAME Godana /Nemo/
2 GIVN Godana
2 _MARNM Nemo
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ejersa Lefo
3 CTRY Ethiopia
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Godana Nemo was balabat of Mecha (ሜጫ) in the early 19th century. A renowned warrior, reputed to have 999 kills, he was killed at Ejersa Lefo by a stick thrown by a shepherd.   In accordance with Oromo tradition, wh
2 CONC erein those killed by human hand are not buried, Godana was left as nourishment for vultures ("የ አሞራ ሲሳይ").  Later, as one of his enemies, crying "This is the man who exterminated my kin!" , attacked his remains with a sword, one 
2 CONC bone flew into the attacker's eye and killed him. Thus, it is said that Godana raised his kill count to 1000 after his death.  There was no one throughout Mecha who hadn't heard of his status as a respected giant of Mecha.  Godana
2 CONC  Nemo expanded the realm of his father up to the Berga river, and ruled an area of 900 ጋሻ (36000 hectares).
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: 
2 CONT
2 CONT "ጃገማ ኬሎ - የ በጋው  መብረቅ (የ ሕይወት ታሪክ )",  ፍቅረ ማርቆስ ደስታ አንደጻፈው
2 CONT
2 CONT "Jagema Kelo - The Lighting of Summer (biography)",  by Fiqre Marqos Desta.  English translation by Nemo Semret.
